# Allowlist approach: ignore everything, then explicitly allow tracked files.
#
# fish writes runtime state here (fish_variables for universal variables, and
# whatever plugins or `funcsave` leave behind), so a default-deny keeps it out.

*

# A file cannot be re-included while its parent directory is excluded, so each
# tracked directory is listed explicitly.
!conf.d/
!functions/
!completions/

!.gitignore
!config.fish
!conf.d/*.fish
!functions/*.fish
!completions/*.fish
